timelib (https://github.com/derickr/timelib), version 2022.10 as vendored by
MongoDB, is ported in internal/util/timelib, and its time zone resolution and
calendar functions are ported in internal/handler/common/aggregations/operators
(timezone.go, datemath.go), so that date expressions match MongoDB. Its
built-in time zone database (timezonedb.h, version 2024.1, derived from the
public domain IANA tz database) is converted into internal/util/timelib/tzdb.
